ubject of the equation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{6}{5y+3} \\\\ x(5y+3) & =6 \\\\ 5xy+3x & =6 \\\\ 5xy & =6-3x \\\\ y & =\\frac{6-3x}{5x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the inverse function is \n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{6-3x}{5x}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186555809 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7266d5c7-67b9-59db-b994-07dcb143af1f" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Inverse of a Simple Rational Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5c195de8-8bba-5c8b-9bec-4e47479c6c5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+1}{x-3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555205} {:answer/id #uuid "7870a35c-4790-51f7-b844-1fb073613a1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+3}{4x-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555277} {:answer/id #uuid "8a0af4fb-bdca-5a5e-9eb1-ce0e1aa654e6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{3x+4}{x-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555323} {:answer/id #uuid "93555d58-3e10-594c-a4df-d9a426cb1046" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{4x+3}{x-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555348} {:answer/id #uuid "f1ab7bc3-3996-50e9-a78f-39edab0786aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{4x+1}{x-3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555594}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f1ab7bc3-3996-50e9-a78f-39edab0786aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{4x+1}{x-3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555594} :answer-field/id #uuid "d65d5fd1-ca18-5efb-8d9b-0ed54089f732" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555744}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "58d6a2d3-405c-5b5e-b02f-68804a6747aa" :question/math-academy-id "q-148499" :question/problem "Find the inverse of the function $f(x)=\\frac{3x+1}{x-4}.$" :question/worked-solution "To find ${f}^{-1}(x),$ we start by replacing $f(x)$ with $y:$\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{3x+1}{x-4}\n$$\n\nNow, interchanging $x$ and $y$ gives\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{3y+1}{y-4}.\n$$\n\nThen, we make $y$ the subject of the equation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{3y+1}{y-4} \\\\ x(y-4) & =3y+1 \\\\ xy-4x & =3y+1 \\\\ xy-3y & =4x+1 \\\\ y(x-3) & =4x+1 \\\\ y & =\\frac{4x+1}{x-3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the inverse function is \n\n$$\n{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{4x+1}{x-3}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186555803 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7266d5c7-67b9-59db-b994-07dcb143af1f" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Inverse of a Simple Rational Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6699e128-718f-5db1-8a5f-945b88bd793a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{1-3x}{x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555231} {:answer/id #uuid "6fd02d5c-098e-5bda-aef9-22dfd59c8033" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{1-2x}{x+3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555255} {:answer/id #uuid "7e39ef11-c972-593e-a0d4-7e6de8c0916d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{3x+1}{2-x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555290} {:answer/id #uuid "9f0b91ef-dfcc-59c1-86ef-6696e2a00f41" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{f}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{1-3x}{x+2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186555383} {:answer/id #uuid "e17b707f-0130-5fa7-b360-4dcc6e6ed3e0" :answer/type 